<title>ISRAEL: 29 wounded in Tel Aviv blast.</title>
<headline>29 wounded in Tel Aviv blast.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 29 people were wounded in a blast at a cafe in central Tel Aviv on Friday, Israeli hospital officials said.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Ichilov hospital told Israel's army radio his facility had received 22 wounded. An official at Tel Hashomer hospital told Israel Radio his institution had seven wounded.</p>
